---

<section class="relative bg-black text-white overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"
  >
    <!-- TEXT -->
    <div class="space-y-6 animate-fade-up">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight uppercase">
        <span class="text-[#FAB927]">Make</span>
        <span class="text-white"> Yourself</span>
        <span class="text-[#A61AD7]"> See</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#FAB927] uppercase tracking-wide">
        Impulsá tu negocio hacia nuevas alturas
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-xl">
        Diseñamos experiencias digitales estratégicas que convierten visitantes
        en clientes y marcas en referentes.
      </p>

      <!-- BENEFITS -->
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm md:text-base">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#A61AD7]">✔</span>
          <span
            ><strong>Soluciones personalizadas</strong> centradas en UX/UI.</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#A61AD7]">✔</span>
          <span
            ><strong>Mayor retención</strong> con estrategias de conversión.</span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#A61AD7]">✔</span>
          <span
            ><strong>Más rentabilidad</strong> con diseño orientado a resultados.</span
          >
        </li>
      </ul>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 pt-4">
        <a
          href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=+541132473163&text=Hola%20Make%20Yourself%20See"
          target="_blank"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-[#A71BDB] hover:bg-[#671585] transition text-white font-semibold"
        >
          Agendar llamado
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=+541132473163&text=Hola%20quiero%20info%20sobre%20los%20cursos"
          target="_blank"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg border border-[#A71BDB] text-[#FAB927] hover:bg-[#A71BDB]/20 transition font-semibold"
        >
          Ver cursos
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- IMAGE -->
    <div class="relative flex justify-center animate-fade-in">
      <img
        src="/logoNew.webp"
        alt="Make Yourself See"
        width="420"
        height="420"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        class="rounded-full shadow-2xl"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(24px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.96);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
  }

  .animate-fade-up {
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out both;
  }

  .animate-fade-in {
    animation: fadeIn 1.1s ease-out both;
  }
</style>
